@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System: asks to open the settings
System --> User: shows the settings with the current theme and language
User -> System: chooses a theme (system, light or dark)
System --> User: saves the choice and redraws the screen with the new theme

note right of System
  Preferences are applied again on every app start.
  The default theme is dark.
end note
@enduml
